where postFailureErrorComment does removeLabel + postComment with ticketKey. So behavior change: when params.ticket is undefined but inputFolderPath exists → original posted nothing; new posts the error comment. This is in the outer catch — an error path. Benign improvement, arguably. But strictly "same side effects" — minor deviation, worth a SUGESTION note or even noting as acceptable. Also when params.ticket undefined: original's postComment threw → swallowed → no comment; new posts comment. Fine.

